WEBVTT

c1
00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:01.720
Hello, friends!

c2
00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.450
I am Nour.

c3
00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:04.150
I have

c4
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.950
one big,

c5
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.830
yummy leaf.

c6
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:08.260
I eat it

c7
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:09.640
all alone.

c8
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:10.840
Not much fun.

c9
00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:12.410
I eat it

c10
00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.510
all again.

c11
00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.430
Still not fun.

c12
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:17.520
Look! Here comes

c13
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:18.980
my friend Pip.

c14
00:00:19.695 --> 00:00:21.375
Let us share!

c15
00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:21.475
Now we

c16
00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:22.935
both smile.

c17
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.480
Sharing makes

c18
00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.080
friends happy.

c19
00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:28.090
Slow and steady,

c20
00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.010
side by side!
